{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29111","headline":"送卢先辈自衡岳赴复州嘉礼二首 二 · 许浑","name":"送卢先辈自衡岳赴复州嘉礼二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘南诗客海中行，鹏翅垂云不自矜。\n秋水静磨金镜土，夜风寒结玉壶冰。\n万重岭峤辞衡岳，千里山陂问竟陵。\n醉倚西楼人已远，柳溪无浪月澄澄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}